      "widgets_values": [
        "subject_definitions:\n<Subject 1> is the woman in <Picture 1>. S1 uses the vocal identity/timbre reference in <Audio 1>; the reference is not the target dialogue.\nsummary:\nOne stable portrait shot, consistent face and clothing, soft fixed studio lighting.\ndetailed_description:\nDuring 00:00.000–00:02.000, S1 speaks calmly in a neutral conversational voice, relaxed eyebrows and an even natural cadence. S1 looks at the camera and says <d>[Mandarin]你终于回来了。</d> She says this short line once and finishes it within the opening two seconds. During 00:02.000–00:03.042, she closes her lips, gives one small natural blink and a quiet breath without words. The camera, background and lighting stay unchanged. No additional speech, no subtitles.\noverall_soundscape:\nClear newly generated speech, quiet room tone, no music.",
